# ThinkTank

TypeScript/Yarn/Turborepo monorepo with a shared React Native Web UI package.

```sh
yarn install
yarn desktop # starts Electron
yarn mobile  # starts Expo
```

`@think-tank/ui` defines components with React Native primitives, which are consumed by both Expo and Electron.
